Message received
from Rajya Sabha that Rajya Sabha at its sitting held on the 30th November,
2006 passed the Indian Rifles (Repeal) Bill, 2006.

Need
for proper maintenance of the strategic Sansari-Kilar-Thirot Road link, 
Himachal Pradesh with Jammu and Kashmir.

Further discussion on the motion
for consideration of the constitution (One Hundred and Fifth Amendment) Bill,
2006 moved by Shri Sivraj V. Patil on the 17<sup>th</sup> May (Bill Passed).

Introduction of the Persons with
 Disabilities (Equal Opportunities, Protection of Rights and Full Participation
) (Amendment) Bill, 2006 ( Substitution of new Sections for Section 31).

Discussion on the motion
for introduction of Parliament (Prevention of Disqualification) Amendment Bill,
2006. (Motion adopted and Bill introduced).
